(* ATS2 driver of the test of the constraint solver (pats_constraint3*, pats_jsonize_synent2; see PORTING.md, "Constraint solving (constraint3)", and c3_gen.py) *)
(* ****** ****** *)
//
// Runs the problems of a data file (c3_gen.py) through the interpreter of c3exec_gen.hats and prints the results; c3dump1.dats is the same driver
// for the ATS1 build of src/: the two outputs (stdout and stderr) must be identical.
//
(* ****** ****** *)
